{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP action and roguelike multiplayer combat.<strong></strong><br><br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> \u2013 A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> is a roguelike action game set in a mysterious otherworld.  <br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, encounter a wide variety of items and enemies\u2014some of which can even join you as allies.<br><br><strong>Play Solo</strong> <br>In <i>Deadly Wonderland</i>, when no other players are available, a bot companion will join you. A fully offline mode is also available. <br>In Versus modes, if there are too few players, you can add bot opponents. In \u201cOffline Battle Training,\u201d you can battle against bots under the same rules as actual matches. <br><br><strong>Or with Many Players</strong> <br><i>Deadly Wonderland</i> supports up to 3 players in co-op. Versus modes allow up to 8 players to battle at once. <br> <br> <br><strong>\u2605Premium Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Steam version, the following features are included in the base price and unlocked from the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Realm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume Parts:\u00a0 Cat Set, Dog Set, Rabbit Set, Fox Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you come to, you find yourself in a small village inhabited by fairies. However, they despise trouble and drive you out of the village. With nowhere to go, you wander aimlessly through a forest bathed in hues of violet. In the dazzling castle that looms far in the distance, what could possibly await you?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/1f0b4e5368baa0bce1d554211089e8aa.avif?t=1757978579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Clear: Fairy Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/52dd68bfb5c397100f0fc3c2e2215eb976534b16.jpg"},{"name":"All Clear: Angel Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/4388477ff576917ef474f7f3b108700c46c66c6c.jpg"},{"name":"All Clear: Devil Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/04d66de890492f8041bebe607ec0130135862c6f.jpg"},{"name":"Fairy Realm Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/6b94d0ada00a2c4d9fcd236e1379b766d6ad0226.jpg"},{"name":"Angel Realm Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/797959c4ffb8d3616c0163042d525bbb545e9289.jpg"},{"name":"Devil Realm Cleared (Online)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/2d330bbb6a411be8398d8db24a79659fd9e25752.jpg"},{"name":"Devil Realm Cleared (Offilne)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/38be5a06a1277715f6ad34833719afe2c4abce58.jpg"},{"name":"Species Compendium Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/eecf51547d71f990adc6bf1b157ab30a1ffeec4c.jpg"},{"name":"Item Compendium Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2758810/f3e5abe29f66